Route → Lambda mapping for the /workbench/seasons* API (verified against
API Gateway miinu7boec, 2026-08-11).

NOTE: the "seasons" feature was provisioned but never finished — the frontend
calls none of these routes and the sd_workbench_records_* tables hold 0 rows.
The three sync routes and their handler (workbench-sync) were retired in #529.
The nine routes below remain wired to the live sd_workbench_handler, which has
no router and returns its summary payload for any GET.

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐
│ API Endpoint                                                │ Lambda Function              │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤
│ GET    /workbench/seasons                                   │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ POST   /workbench/seasons                                   │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ GET    /workbench/seasons/{season_id}                       │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ PATCH  /workbench/seasons/{season_id}                       │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ GET    /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items                 │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ POST   /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items                 │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ PATCH  /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items                 │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ GET    /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items/{item_id}       │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ PATCH  /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items/{item_id}       │ sd_workbench_handler         │
│ DELETE /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items/{item_id}       │ sd_workbench_handler         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘

Retired in #529 (function + routes deleted):
  POST /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/import                    → workbench-sync
  POST /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items/{item_id}/sync-back → workbench-sync
  POST /workbench/seasons/{season_id}/items/end-season          → workbench-sync
